  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.0-rc.2 — release candidate, tracking PostQuantum.FileEncryption 1.0.0-rc.2 in lockstep. The .pqfe container format (v2) is FROZEN for 1.x. README now presents Hybrid as the single recommended public-key path with a migration note from the deprecated inline ML-KEM-only mode in the core (PQFE002). PublicAPI analyzer + locked baseline, package icon, EnablePackageValidation against the 1.0.0-rc.1 baseline.",
